  "description": {
    "text": "First sold with the Black & White set in April 2011: one Black & White booster pack and a sampling pack of three common cards, with one holofoil promo, Snivy BW06, Tepig BW07 or Oshawott BW08. A fourth version, with Ducklett BW17, reached stores such as Target and Wal-Mart in June 2011. Ducklett came only in this blister; the three first partners also came in the three-pack blister of April 2011, with three booster packs and a coin.",
